            <span style="color: #059669; font-weight: bold;">[|||||] ຍິງບາໂຄດ ຫຼື ຄົ້ນຫາສິນຄ້າ (F1)...</span>
            <span style="background: #059669; color: white; padding: 4px 12px; border-radius: 4px; font-size: 9pt;">ຄົ້ນຫາ</span>
